      <section id="welcome" class="card">
        <h3>Welcome</h3>
        <p>
          Congratulations on your purchase. Your EPK is fully yours.
          There are no subscriptions and you keep the full website code and content.
        </p>
        <p>
          You do not need to know how to code to use this product.
